{"data":{"html":"<table class=\"page-table\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-center\" >中華民國113年有價證券櫃檯買賣市場開（休）市日期表<\u002ftd>\r\n    <\u002ftr>\r\n<\u002ftable>\r\n<table class=\"page-table\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <th width=\"34%\" nowrap bgcolor=\"#EDEDED\" class=\"page-table-head-center\">紀念節日名稱<\u002fth>\r\n        <th width=\"5%\" nowrap bgcolor=\"#EDEDED\" class=\"page-table-head-center\">日期<\u002fth>\r\n        <th width=\"5%\" nowrap bgcolor=\"#EDEDED\" class=\"page-table-head-center\">星期<\u002fth>\r\n        <th nowrap bgcolor=\"#EDEDED\" class=\"page-table-head-center\">說明<\u002fth>\r\n    <\u002ftr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\">中華民國開國紀念日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\">\r\n\t\t1月1日\t\r\n\t\t<\u002ftd>\t\t\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\">\r\n\t\t一\r\n\t\t<\u002ftd>\r\n\t\t<td class=\"page-table-body-left\">\r\n\t\t依規定放假1日。\r\n\t\t<\u002ftd>\r\n    <\u002ftr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\">國曆新年開始交易日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\">1月2日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\">二<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\">國曆新年開始交易<\u002ftd>\r\n    <\u002ftr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\">農曆春節前<strong>國際債券交易系統<\u002fstrong>最後交易日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\">2月2日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\">五<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\">2月5日、2月6日及2月7日市場無交易，僅辦理給付結算。<\u002ftd>\r\n    <\u002ftr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\">農曆春節前<strong>股票交易系統<\u002fstrong>最後交易日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\" rowspan=\"2\">2月5日<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td nowrap class=\"page-table-body-center\" rowspan=\"2\">一<\u002ftd>\r\n        <td class=\"page-table-body-left\" rowspan=\"2\">2月6日及2月7日市場無交易，僅辦理給付結算。<\u002ftd>\r\